  "solution": {
    "text": "Amt. deposited $=\\frac{\\text { E. wt } \\times \\text { Q }}{96500}$;\n$$\n107.870=\\frac{107.870}{96500} \\times \\mathrm{Q} ; \\quad \\therefore \\mathrm{Q}=96500 \\mathrm{C}\n$$"
